{"id": "70153", "title": "将就", "author": "春天不开花", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 35, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/70/70153.htm", "intro": "他们对她的那些情啊爱啊，每当遇到他们的“初恋情人”和“真爱”的时候，也便成浮云了。\r\n    第一次，她变成了炮灰渣，第二次，连个渣都不剩，直接挫骨扬灰化作春泥更护花了。\r\n    婚姻宝典上有那么一句话，维持婚姻需要迁就，她铭记在心。结果一不小心，她因为迁就，倒把自己变成了将就~~~~~~(>_<)~~~~\r\n    直到后来她才明白，她的爱情天时地利人和，只是迟到了一步。\r\n    一句话文案：从头到尾充满JQ的温馨文。\r\n    作者有话要说：不要被文案吓去了，这是一篇温馨文，温馨文啊，如果不小心虐到了，大家要鞭策我啊啊啊啊~~", "base": "files/article/html/70/70153", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "第一章", "file": "10859111.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二章", "file": "10859112.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三章", "file": "10859113.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四章", "file": "10859114.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五章", "file": "10859115.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六章", "file": "10859116.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七章", "file": "10859117.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八章", "file": "10859118.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第九章", "file": "10859119.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十章", "file": "10859120.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十一章", "file": "10859121.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十二章", "file": "10859122.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十三章", "file": "10859123.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十四章", "file": "10859124.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十五章", "file": "10859125.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十六章", "file": "10859126.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十七章", "file": "10859127.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十八章", "file": "10859128.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十九章", "file": "10859129.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十章", "file": "10859130.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十一章", "file": "10859131.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十二章", "file": "10859132.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十三章", "file": "10859133.html", "ava